<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Klinik.Net launcher mark — scaffold asset for Story 1.1.

  Derived from prototype/assets/logo-mark.svg, but NOT a verbatim copy: the
  SVG's linear gradient (#FF385C to #C01336) and 15px squircle radius do not
  survive into a VectorDrawable, so the background here is flat #FF385C with
  sharp corners. The car glyph itself is the lucide "car-front" outline (ISC
  licence), geometry unchanged from the source SVG.

  This is a placeholder that establishes the asset pipeline. Replace with an
  adaptive icon (mipmap-anydpi-v26) once the design system lands in Story 2.1;
  on API 26+ a legacy icon is not masked to the launcher shape.

  On the ISC notice: lucide requires the copyright and permission notice in
  distributions. That belongs in a shipped NOTICE file, not only here.
-->
